        "collapsible_row_jg8BPx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pre-Enrolment information",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For students preparing to complete our course, please download the full <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/Student_PreEnrolment_Information_Kit_V2_1_20240502.pdf?v=1725236735\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/Student_PreEnrolment_Information_Kit_V2_1_20240502.pdf?v=1725236735\">Student Pre-Enrolment Information Kit</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nAKWe3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Victorian Student Number (VSN)",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The VSN is a student identification number that is assigned by the Department of Education & Early Childhood Development. The number is unique to each student & will be used as a key identifier on student's school records until reaching the age of 25.<br/><br/>The VSN only applies to students under the age of 25 who reside in the State of Victoria. For more information, please visit <a href=\"https://www.vcaa.vic.edu.au/Pages/HomePage.aspx\" title=\"https://www.vcaa.vic.edu.au/Pages/HomePage.aspx\">The Victorian Curriculum and Assessment Authority</a> website or <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/VSN-information-for-student.pdf?v=1706559457\" title=\"The Victorian Student Number\">download</a> the information booklet The Victorian Student Number.<br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kpWetL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "USI Information",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>From 1 January 2015, each student will need a Unique Student Identifier (USI) to obtain their certificate or qualification from a Registered Training Organisation. This will apply when undertaking our Nationally Recognised Test and Tag Course.<br/><br/>It's a free and easy process for students to create their own USI's online. To do this, please go to the <a href=\"https://www.usi.gov.au/\" title=\"Unique Student Identifier\">Unique Student Identifier</a> home page. If you require any further information, please feel free to <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">contact us</a> during business hours.</p><p><strong>Helpful Links</strong></p><ul><li>The student webpage on <a href=\"https://usi.gov.au/students/training-records-and-transcript\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://usi.gov.au/students/training-records-and-transcript\">Transcript/Training records</a></li><li>The <a href=\"https://usi.gov.au/video/how-view-and-download-my-usi-transcript\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://usi.gov.au/video/how-view-and-download-my-usi-transcript\">'How to view and download my USI transcript'</a> video</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
